# Sanātana Dharma Dharohar

> An evidence-first, non-sectarian, encyclopedic knowledge repository dedicated to the preservation, understanding, and practice of Sanātana Dharma.

---

## Vision

To build the most structured, authentic, and practically useful digital knowledge base of Sanātana Dharma.

The repository aims to guide a sincere seeker from curiosity (Jijñāsā) to advanced sādhana using scriptural evidence, traditional commentaries, and authentic sampradāyas.

---

## Guiding Principles

- Pramāṇa First
- Scripture before opinion
- Non-sectarian
- Evidence over popularity
- Sanskrit source before translation
- Every claim traceable to an authentic source

